# One haptic for each dispatch of a binding that has one (MAP-25, ADR-0065),
# at the time of the dispatch: south's tick at its press; east's confirm at
# its press, not at the repeats of Space; west's pulse2 when its tap is
# committed (940), for the second tap of the double tap (1240) and when the
# hold starts (2250); north's error at its release. rb has no haptic and
# dpad.up is blocked.
tick@0
confirm@100
pulse2@940
pulse2@1240
pulse2@2250
error@2600
